{
  "name": "Telegram Daily Standup Collector",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 9,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Schedule 9AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [250, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "🌅 Good morning team!\n\nPlease share your standup update:\n1️⃣ What did you do yesterday?\n2️⃣ What will you do today?\n3️⃣ Any blockers?\n\nReply to this message with your update.",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "name": "Send Standup Question",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["message"],
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "name": "Collect Replies",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [250, 550],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst results = [];\nfor (const item of items) {\n  const msg = item.json.message || {};\n  results.push({\n    json: {\n      username: msg.from?.username || msg.from?.first_name || 'unknown',\n      userId: msg.from?.id,\n      update: msg.text || '',\n      chatId: msg.chat?.id,\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n      date: new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]\n    }\n  });\n}\nreturn results;"
      },
      "name": "Parse Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [500, 550]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": { "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "value": "Standups" },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Log to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [750, 550],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$json.chatId}}",
        "text": "=✅ Standup recorded, @{{$json.username}}! Thanks for the update.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "name": "Confirm Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1000, 550],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 17,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Schedule 5PM Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [250, 800]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "documentId": { "value": "" },
        "sheetName": { "value": "Standups" },
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read Today Standups",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [500, 800],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nconst today = new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0];\nconst todayUpdates = items.filter(i => i.json.date === today);\nlet summary = `📋 <b>Daily Standup Summary - ${today}</b>\\n\\n`;\nif (todayUpdates.length === 0) {\n  summary += '⚠️ No standup updates received today.';\n} else {\n  todayUpdates.forEach((item, idx) => {\n    summary += `👤 <b>@${item.json.username}</b>\\n${item.json.update}\\n\\n`;\n  });\n  summary += `\\n📊 Total updates: ${todayUpdates.length}`;\n}\nreturn [{ json: { summary, count: todayUpdates.length } }];"
      },
      "name": "Aggregate Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [750, 800]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "={{$json.summary}}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "HTML"
        }
      },
      "name": "Post Summary to Group",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1000, 800],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram Daily Standup Collector\n\n**Flow 1:** Schedule 9AM → send standup question to group\n**Flow 2:** Collect replies → parse → log to Sheets → confirm\n**Flow 3:** Schedule 5PM → aggregate today's updates → post summary\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Set Telegram Bot API credentials\n2. Set group chat ID in Send Standup Question and Post Summary nodes\n3. Create Google Sheet with columns: username, userId, update, chatId, timestamp, date",
        "width": 450,
        "height": 250
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1250, 300]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Schedule 9AM": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Send Standup Question", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Collect Replies": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Parse Reply", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Reply": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Log to Sheets", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Log to Sheets": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Confirm Reply", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Schedule 5PM Summary": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Read Today Standups", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Read Today Standups": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Aggregate Summary", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Aggregate Summary": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Post Summary to Group", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  }
}